# Title: Suspicious Curl File Upload - Linux
# ID: 00b90cc1-17ec-402c-96ad-3a8117d7a582
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems), Cedric MAURUGEON (Update)
# Date: 2022-09-15
# Tags: attack.exfiltration, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1567, attack.t1105
# Description: Detects a suspicious curl process start the adds a file to a web request
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((((process.command_line:* --form* OR process.command_line:* --upload-file * OR process.command_line:* --data * OR process.command_line:* --data-*)) OR (process.command_line:/\s-[FTd]\s/)) AND (process.executable:*/curl)) AND NOT (((process.command_line:*://localhost* OR process.command_line:*://127.0.0.1*))))
